      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI customer support assistant.\n\nCustomer Details\n\nName:\n{{ $('03 - Clean Customer Data').item.json.customerName }}\n\nEmail:\n{{ $('03 - Clean Customer Data').item.json.email }}\n\nMessage:\n{{ $('02 - Validate Request').item.json.body.message }}\n\nYour job:\n\n1. Identify the customer's intent.\n2. Write a helpful professional reply.\n3. Decide if the conversation should be transferred to a human.\n\nIntent must be one of:\n\nFAQ\nLead\nSupport\nComplaint\nHuman\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\n{\n  \"intent\":\"\",\n  \"reply\":\"\",\n  \"needsHuman\":false,\n  \"priority\":\"Low\",\n  \"reasoning\":\"\"\n}",
